WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:14.010
I landed inside a small crater — a hole-in-one — and found little round pebbles the scientists called blueberries. They formed in water.

2
00:00:14.710 --> 00:00:20.090
I kept driving for more than 14 years, farther than a marathon.

3
00:00:20.790 --> 00:00:24.310
Then a huge dust storm blocked out the Sun.

4
00:00:25.010 --> 00:00:29.040
My last message home was about power and darkness.

5
00:00:29.740 --> 00:00:34.960
Planned for 90 days. I stayed for fourteen years.
